cache/

# Resume scratch and bulk results from the glycerol -> FFA panel arm. The shards exist so a
# killed run resumes; the parquets are the probes' raw output. Both are reproducible from the
# committed scripts and the recorded seed -- `conditions_null.tsv` byte-identically so, which
# is the property `ecspr draw` is built to have. The TSVs beside them are the findings and are
# tracked.
out/**/shards_*/
out/**/*.parquet
out/**/conditions_null.tsv
out/**/run.log
out/dryrun/
